            "Certified to ANSI/ISEA 107-2020 Type R Class 3 in a waterproof shell, so your crew stays compliant in steady rain without layering a shell over the tape. 2.5-layer fluorescent polyester, 15,000mm (hydrostatic head), fully seam-taped. 50mm segmented reflective tape, zip-off hood, radio loop and mic tab on both shoulders. Embroidery field on the left chest.",
